  "result": "**Implemented rules:** Nothing in the code depends on the amount. `ApprovalsController` is marked `[RequireRole(\"Approver\", \"Admin\")]`, and `ApprovalService.Approve` takes a single approver and moves the invoice straight to Approved. So a 75,000 invoice can be approved by an Approver or Admin with one approval, and a 600,000 invoice needs the same: one approval from an Approver or Admin. There are no thresholds or second-approver checks in the Domain, Api, or tests.\n\n**Proposed, not implemented:** `docs/use-cases/UC-1-bulk-approval.md` says \"Invoices over $1,000 need a second approver before they are final.\" That is a feature brief for bulk approval, not a rule in force. If it were built, a 600,000 invoice would need two approvals.",
